.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt MAP 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm map
.Nd map memory into a process
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft usize
.Fn map "Handle proc" "Handle memobj" "usize offset" "usize addr" "usize len" "usize flags"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call maps .Fa len bytes of .Fa memobj into .Fa proc.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
